# Garment colour in logo preview boxes

## Two separate surfaces (do not merge)

| Surface | File | Element | Colour source |
|---------|------|---------|---------------|
| **Basket** | `basket.html` | `.logo-thumb-wrap` | `getItemColorHex(item)` + inline `style="--garment-bg:…; background-color:…"` |
| **Customize popup** | `mobile/js/customize.js` | `.position-preview-content` | `applyGarmentColorToPositionPreviews()` → `--garment-bg` + `backgroundColor` |

Registry: `brandedukv15-child/assets/js/color-hex.js` (`BrandedColorHex`).

## Rules

1. **Never** force `#ffffff` on `.position-preview-content` or `.logo-thumb-wrap` in shared CSS (apron/hoodie white applies only to `.garment-tint-stack` / `.position-preview` photo area).
2. **Apron/hoodie** tint: white card + mask on PNG — logo preview box below still uses catalog hex for contrast.
3. Popup layout changes (`#positionsPopupOverlay`) must not remove `var(--garment-bg)` on `.position-preview-content`.
4. Basket `.logo-thumb-wrap` uses `!important` on `background-color: var(--garment-bg)` so `mobile.css` cannot zero it out.
5. When fixing popup size/layout, test **basket.html** logo row still shows correct garment colour.

## Colour names

- Strip trailing `*` in `BrandedColorHex.normName`.
- Add missing catalog names (e.g. `safety orange`) to `BUILTIN` in `color-hex.js`.
- Short API names (e.g. `Forest`) resolve via `colorId` slug (`forest-green`) and prefix match (`forest` → `forest green`).
- Basket label: `getItemColorLabel(item)` / `BrandedColorHex.resolveDisplayName`.

## Google checkout auth

- **Only** edit `brandedukv15-child/assets/js/checkout-auth.js` for OAuth redirect logic.
- Do not redefine `coStartGoogleAuth` in `checkout.html` (no fetch pre-checks).
